Within radius [2, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)], transfer heat from a group of enemies bodies to their equipment, freezing them to the floor while the excess heat disables their weapons and armor.

Those afflicted will be dealt [47, 63, 75, 86, 95 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Cold and [47, 63, 75, 86, 95 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Fire damage, and be pinned (Frozen Feet) and disarmed for [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5; MP 100)] turns.

Targets suffering both types of damage will also have have their Armour and saves reduced by [11, 14, 17, 20, 22 (TL1-5; MP 100)].

The chance to apply the effects and the duration increase with your Mindpower.
